# The container runs Linux. entrypoint.sh with CRLF line endings fails at exec
# with a "no such file or directory" error naming the interpreter, which reads
# as a missing shell rather than a line-ending problem. Windows checkouts have
# core.autocrlf enabled by default, so pin this rather than relying on it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
